  "fragment": "\\begin{proof}\nPick a strongly cartesian morphism\n$\\text{pr}_2^*z \\to z$ lying over\n$\\text{pr}_2 : p(x) \\times_{p(y)} p(z) \\to p(z)$. Then\n$\\text{pr}_2^*z = x \\times_y z$ by\nLemma \\ref{lemma-strongly-cartesian-fibre-product}.\n\\end{proof}",
